cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "fhir-repair: deterministic-first repair of non-conformant FHIR R4 resources"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit that takes broken FHIR R4 resources and produces validator-passing
  fixed versions. Deterministic strategies handle what can be fixed
  mechanically, an LLM sees only the genuinely interpretive remainder, and a
  hallucination guard refuses changes that would invent clinical data. Every
  action is recorded in a machine-readable audit log.
type: software
